SUMMARY:3RD ANNUAL EMO NITE! WITH THE WARPED BAND
LOCATION:Stockroom East | 625 E. Jefferson Blvd. | South Bend\, IN 46617
DESCRIPTION:Stockroom East's 3rd Annual Emo Nite! featuring Pennsylvania's 
 legendary The Warped Band: The Official Tribute to Warped Tour! Bringing 
 the sound and spirit of the most iconic summer festival to life. Relive t
 he anthems that defined a generation with hits from Blink‑182\, Green D
 ay\, Papa Roach\, Good Charlotte\, NOFX\, Goldfinger\, Avril Lavigne\, Li
 nkin Park\, Pierce The Veil\, 3OH!3\, and more. Fans vote on the setlist 
 for every show\, putting the experience in your hands and making no two n
 ights the same.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/3rd-a
 nnual-emo-nite-with-the-warped-band/
