UID:329acda146406c6f7c9e78c6@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260907T180731Z
SUMMARY:ACTORS FROM THE LONDON STAGE PRESENTS MUCH ADO ABOUT NOTHING
LOCATION:DeBartolo Performing Arts Center\, 100 Performing Arts Center | No
 tre Dame\, 46556
DESCRIPTION:Presenting Series Exuberant\, joyful\, and above all\, ravishin
 gly entertaining\, Much Ado About Nothing is one of Shakespeare's most ce
 lebrated and enduringly popular comedies. This delightful romp deftly exp
 lores notions of identity\, marriage\, and communication through the spar
 ring between Benedick and Beatrice\, two of Shakespeare's most gloriously
  realized characters. With its piquant blend of prickly banter\, mistaken
  identities\, and swoon-worthy romance\, Much Ado About Nothing is sheer 
 theatrical delight. Much Ado About Nothing is brought to life by Actors F
 rom The London Stage\, the renowned 5-actor touring group founded in 1975
  by Dr. Homer "Murph" Swander and Sir Patrick Stewart\, along with many o
 ther celebrated actors from the Royal Shakespeare Company. This remarkabl
 e company has called Shakespeare at Notre Dame its artistic home since 20
 00\, and travels to multiple colleges and universities nationwide twice a
 nnually. Each member of this self-directed ensemble assumes multiple role
 s while favoring minimal props and costumes\, creating a theatrical exper
 ience unlike any other. ASL available for Friday's performance. For ticke
 ts within view of the ASL interpreter\, click here. Co-sponsored by Shake
 speare at Notre Dame.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events
 /actors-from-the-london-stage-presents-much-ado-about-nothing-2/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/actors-from-the-london-stage-pres
 ents-much-ado-about-nothing-2/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260910T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260910T203000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
