DTSTAMP:20260907T180731Z
SUMMARY:GUSTAVO CORTIÑAS TRIO
LOCATION:Merrimans’ Playhouse | 401 E. Colfax Ave.\, Suite 135 | South Be
 nd\, IN 46617
DESCRIPTION:Gustavo Cortiñas presents a composer-led program featuring ori
 ginal compositions selected from his recorded works. Rather than focusing
  on a single album\, the project offers a representative cross-section of
  his evolving body of work\, highlighting contemporary jazz compositions 
 that combine structured writing with collective improvisation and reflect
  his ongoing exploration of identity\, culture\, and human connection. Th
 e repertoire may include selections from Snapshot (2013)\, ESSE (2017)\, 
 Desafío Candente (2021)\, Kind Regards (2022)\, Live in Chicago (2024)\,
  The Crisis Knows No Borders (2025)\, and The Drum Also Sings (2026).\n\n
 Artie Black - sax\n\nKitt Lyles - bass\n\nGustavo Cortiñas - drums\n\nMo
 re Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/gustavo-corti%C3%B1as-trio
 /
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/gustavo-corti%C3%B1as-trio/
