BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:29b1519e5595533c6f070ade@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260907T180731Z
SUMMARY:LA DIVINA COMETA (2022)
LOCATION:DeBartolo Performing Arts Center\, 100 Performing Arts Center | No
 tre Dame\, 46556
DESCRIPTION:Browning Cinema New at the Browning Directed by Mimmo Paladino 
 Not Rated\, 93 minutes\, DCP In Italian with English subtitles Discussion
  scheduled to follow screening! A journey through a vast fresco painted w
 ith light. Its characters come together like figures in a Nativity scene\
 , weaving stories\, symbols\, and words between folk tradition and experi
 mental exploration. Dante\, a silent witness\, passes through it alongsid
 e Ugolino and Pontormo\, Glenn Gould and Giordano Bruno. A poor family se
 arches for shelter while awaiting five wandering Magi bearing gifts of mu
 sic\, theatre\, painting\, poetry—and nothingness. Will the Divine Come
 t lead them forth to see the stars again? This film is being screened as 
 part of the Raclin Murphy Museum of Art's temporary exhibition Mimmo Pala
 dino: Present into Past. The screening will be followed by a conversation
  with Joseph Becherer\, exhibition curator and director of the Raclin Mur
 phy Museum of Art\, and Theodore J. Cachey Jr.\, Pizzo Family Chair in Da
 nte Studies. This is a free but ticketed event. To guarantee your seat\, 
 please pick up your tickets at least 15 minutes prior to the show\, at wh
 ich point your unclaimed tickets may be used to seat patrons waiting on s
 tandby. Tickets will be available for pick-up at the Ticket Office beginn
 ing one hour prior to the performance. Co-sponsored by the Raclin Murphy 
 Museum of Art\, Italian Studies Center.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitso
 uthbend.com/events/la-divina-cometa-2022/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/la-divina-cometa-2022/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260910T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260910T200000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e17ce0845e8b143a2d41aab6@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260907T180731Z
SUMMARY:MEET SHADE: COMMUNITY PREVIEW FOR SHADE BAR & GRILL
LOCATION:DoubleTree By Hilton Hotel Downtown South Bend | 123 DR MLK Blvd |
  South Bend\, IN 46601
DESCRIPTION:Be among the first to experience Shade—South Bend’s new dow
 ntown gathering place inside the DoubleTree by Hilton South Bend.\n\nJoin
  us Wednesday\, September 9\, from 5:30–8:30 PM for a special community
  preview featuring chef-inspired tastings\, cocktails\, guided tours\, an
 d networking.\n\nWhether you are planning a client dinner\, an after-work
  gathering\, a celebration\, or simply searching for a new place to conne
 ct\, Shade was created with South Bend in mind.\n\nCome meet the team\, e
 xplore the space\, taste the menu\, and discover why Shade is more than a
  restaurant—it is where South Bend gathers.\n\nDoubleTree by Hilton Sou
 th Bend\n\n123 N. Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. Blvd.\n\nSouth Bend\, Indian
 a 46601\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/meet-shade-co
 mmunity-preview-for-shade-bar-grill/
