UID:567c2c11d4262573a1ca7fef@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260907T180731Z
SUMMARY:MEET THE AUTHOR JANE AMMESON - BOOK RELEASE PARTY
LOCATION:Brasserie 23 | 120 Perspective Drive | Granger\, IN 46530
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Brasserie 23 on Thursday\, September 11 at 6:00 PM f
 or a special book release celebration featuring award-winning author Jane
  Simon Ammeson and her newest book\, 100 Things to Do in South Bend\, Ind
 iana\, Before You Die.\n\nWhether you are a lifelong Hoosier\, a proud No
 tre Dame fan\, a weekend traveler\, or someone discovering the area for t
 he first time\, this guide highlights the memorable places\, flavors\, st
 ories\, and experiences that make South Bend and the surrounding communit
 y so special.\n\nGuests will have the opportunity to meet Jane\, learn mo
 re about the inspiration behind the book\, and celebrate the people and p
 laces that make our region unique.\n\nTickets are $25 per person and incl
 ude:\n\n• A signed copy of the book\n\n• A glass of wine\n\n• Light
  hors d’oeuvres\n\n• The opportunity to meet the author\n\nMore Info:
  https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/meet-the-author-jane-ammeson-book-
 release-party/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/meet-the-author-jane-ammeson-book
 -release-party/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260911T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260911T200000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
