 South Bend\, IN 46637
DESCRIPTION:Join us\, along with local fire\, police\, and EMS to commemora
 te the 25th anniversary of the events of September 11\, 2001. Ceremony wi
 ll take place at the Standing Tall Freedom Memorial at St. Patrick's Coun
 ty Park.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/ringing-of-t
 he-bell-2/
